# Versatile Summon Nature's Ally

*(General)*

You've learned to summon a wider array of creatures.

**Prerequisites**: Augment Summoning, Spell Focus (conjuration), Knowledge (nature) 1 rank, Knowledge (planes) 1 rank.

**Benefit**: When you summon one or more animals, humanoids, or vermin using a *summon nature's ally* spell (or an effect that mimics such a spell), instead of granting them the benefit from Augment Summoning, you can instead apply one of the following templates to them: aerial, aqueous, chthonic, fiery, or primordial (see [Simple Summoning Templates](../../magic/expanded-summoning.md#simple-summoning-templates)). If you summon multiple creatures with one casting, they must all have the same template.
